  "median_convention": "average (np.median) -- what collected.json's ply.* columns and therefore section 8.1's aspect/needle figures use. The TRAINER's own metrics.shape block uses torch's LOWER median instead; the two differ by ~2e-6 relative at 500k splats and are not interchangeable at more than ~5 significant figures. hard_needle_frac and needle_frac are fractions, not order statistics, so they are identical either way.",
