    "R1_openweights": "THE VOID ROW. The same recipe before the aux blending-weight fix: it reached a similar thin-axis by destroying the splats, and thin-axis, opacity and dark fraction all reported it as HEALTHIER than baseline. It is the smallest RECORDED collapse, and the upper anchor of every Band 1 threshold.",
    "B0b": "baseline repeat, same seed as B0a",
    "B0d": "baseline repeat on a later commit; section 8.2 established no drift"
  },
